}));

// Apply sanitization to POST/PUT/PATCH requests
app.post('/users', sanitizeInput, validateUserCreate, handleValidationErrors, ...);
app.put('/users/:id', sanitizeInput, validateId, validateUserUpdate, handleValidationErrors, ...);
app.patch('/users/:id', sanitizeInput, validateId, validateUserUpdate, handleValidationErrors, ...);
```

### 5. Insecure Error Handling Implementation

